  "comment": "The default apps of the guest image: where each one's source is pinned, the patches and design files apps.py lays over it, how it is built, and where make-image.py puts it. The LineageOS apps come from their lineage-24.0 branch, pinned to a commit; DocumentsUI comes from AOSP at the commit each image's own build was made from (the build's manifest_<build_id>.xml names it), so it matches the framework it runs on. Move a pin by changing its commit and checking that the app's patches still apply (apps.py fetch).",
